cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use frame_overlap, please cite the article below and the software."
title: "frame_overlap: Bragg-edge imaging with programmable, overlapping neutron pulses, on top of nbragg"
version: 1.0.0.dev0
abstract: >-
  Design and analysis of time-of-flight Bragg-edge transmission measurements
  with several pulses per period: precision (Cramer-Rao bound) and
  time-reduction factor of pulse patterns, bandwidth choppers, a Rietveld fit
  of overlapped spectra through the known pulse pattern, Wiener deconvolution
  as in FOBI, Monte Carlo validation and pattern optimisation, with the
  material model from nbragg.
authors:
